WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.000 --> 00:00:02.268
-Good evening. I'm Seth Meyers.

00:00:02.268 --> 00:00:03.736
This is "Late Night."
We hope you're doing well.

00:00:03.736 --> 00:00:06.472
And now, if you don't mind,
we're going to get to the news.

00:00:06.472 --> 00:00:07.907
In a new interview
on "The View,"

00:00:07.907 --> 00:00:09.275
Vice President Kamala Harris

00:00:09.275 --> 00:00:11.911
said that the 2024 election
will come down to

00:00:11.911 --> 00:00:14.313
"competence versus chaos."

00:00:14.313 --> 00:00:16.483
Of course, if you're
watching "The View,"

00:00:16.483 --> 00:00:18.585
you've already chosen chaos.

00:00:18.585 --> 00:00:20.553
[ Laughter ]

00:00:20.553 --> 00:00:22.421
In the same interview,
Harris criticized

00:00:22.421 --> 00:00:24.557
presidential candidate
Nikki Haley's statement

00:00:24.557 --> 00:00:27.293
that the US has never been
a racist country

00:00:27.293 --> 00:00:30.563
and said, "We cannot get
to a place of progress

00:00:30.563 --> 00:00:32.631
by denying
the existence of racism,"

00:00:32.631 --> 00:00:35.835
but you can get to
the Republican nomination

00:00:35.835 --> 00:00:38.171
for president.

00:00:38.171 --> 00:00:40.206
President Biden traveled
to North Carolina today

00:00:40.206 --> 00:00:41.774
and spoke about
his administration's

00:00:41.774 --> 00:00:43.309
funding
for high-speed Internet,

00:00:43.309 --> 00:00:46.646
which is why he's the only
candidate endorsed by Pornhub.

00:00:46.646 --> 00:00:49.715
[ Laughter ]

00:00:49.715 --> 00:00:50.817
In a post this week --

00:00:50.817 --> 00:00:52.785
They were as surprised
as anyone.

00:00:52.785 --> 00:00:54.587
[ Laughter ]

00:00:54.587 --> 00:00:56.088
In a post this week
on Truth Social,

00:00:56.088 --> 00:00:58.491
former President Trump
referred to Nikki Haley

00:00:58.491 --> 00:01:02.462
using her given first name
of Nimarata and misspelled it,

00:01:02.462 --> 00:01:05.998
though I bet no one noticed
that mistake on Truth Social.

00:01:05.998 --> 00:01:09.269
They're still having a hard time
with "your" and "you're."

00:01:09.269 --> 00:01:11.604
[ Laughter ]

00:01:11.604 --> 00:01:13.440
During a rally last night
in New Hampshire,

00:01:13.440 --> 00:01:16.209
former President Trump mocked
President Biden's competence

00:01:16.209 --> 00:01:18.545
and asked the crowd,
"Would you trust

00:01:18.545 --> 00:01:20.646
Joe Biden
to run your store

00:01:20.646 --> 00:01:22.114
while you go off
to New Hampshire

00:01:22.114 --> 00:01:24.850
to find a small hill
to go skiing?"

00:01:24.850 --> 00:01:27.887
And the crowd responded
with a resounding, "What?

00:01:27.887 --> 00:01:32.391
[ Laughter ]

00:01:32.391 --> 00:01:35.061
Like, we're on your side, man,
but what?"

00:01:35.061 --> 00:01:36.895
[ Laughter ]

00:01:36.895 --> 00:01:39.499
Trump also complained
about his ongoing legal issues

00:01:39.499 --> 00:01:42.435
and said, "You know, I've been
indicted more than Al Capone."

00:01:42.435 --> 00:01:45.338
And I honestly can't tell
if he's bragging or complaining.

00:01:45.338 --> 00:01:48.007
You know, old guys
reach a stage

00:01:48.007 --> 00:01:49.642
where those things
sound the same.

00:01:49.642 --> 00:01:51.410
"I got up at 5:30 this morning!"

00:01:51.410 --> 00:01:53.479
"Okay. Good job. Sorry?

00:01:53.479 --> 00:01:55.315
I don't know what you want."

00:01:56.815 --> 00:01:59.385
And a new interview,
Microsoft co-founder Bill Gates

00:01:59.385 --> 00:02:02.589
said that he's giving away money
at a rate of $9 billion a year,

00:02:02.589 --> 00:02:04.991
and not one penny of it
to a barber.

00:02:04.991 --> 00:02:07.594
[ Laughter ]

00:02:09.229 --> 00:02:12.665
A state lawmaker in Kentucky
recently introduced a new bill

00:02:12.665 --> 00:02:14.300
that would make it legal
for a person

00:02:14.300 --> 00:02:15.835
to have sex
with a first cousin,

00:02:15.835 --> 00:02:18.905
while Alabama
is making it mandatory.

00:02:18.905 --> 00:02:21.407
[ Laughter ]

00:02:25.011 --> 00:02:26.345
I mean, I don't want to judge,

00:02:26.345 --> 00:02:29.782
but that just
doesn't seem right.

00:02:29.782 --> 00:02:32.384
A copy of the first issue of
"The Amazing Spider-Man" comic

00:02:32.384 --> 00:02:35.755
was recently sold at auction
for $1.38 million.

00:02:35.755 --> 00:02:37.090
Said the winner's wife --
[ Laughs ]

00:02:37.090 --> 00:02:38.591
I'm kidding.
He doesn't have a wife.

00:02:38.591 --> 00:02:41.661
[ Laughter ]

00:02:43.762 --> 00:02:46.199
A production company announced
yesterday it's developing

00:02:46.199 --> 00:02:48.735
a Chuck E. Cheese-themed
competition show

00:02:48.735 --> 00:02:50.737
that will have adult contestants

00:02:50.737 --> 00:02:53.672
try life-size versions
of classic arcade games,

00:02:53.672 --> 00:02:56.042
like the one where you try
to eat enough pills

00:02:56.042 --> 00:02:57.577
to get through
a kid's birthday party.

00:02:57.577 --> 00:03:00.146
[ Laughter ]

00:03:00.146 --> 00:03:02.381
And finally, the restaurant
Applebee's has announced

00:03:02.381 --> 00:03:04.384
that it will launch
a date night pass.

00:03:04.384 --> 00:03:05.985
The way it works
is you say "date night"

00:03:05.985 --> 00:03:08.221
and she says "pass."
[ Laughter ]

00:03:08.221 --> 00:03:09.922
And that was a monologue,
everybody!

00:03:09.922 --> 00:03:12.559
[ Cheers and applause ]
We are...up and running.

